    "%lld세부터는 한 해 투자수익이 저축보다 커져요 — 여기서부터 돈이 당신 대신 법니다. 곡선이 직선에서 지수로 휘는 지점이에요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From age %lld, a year's investment gains outgrow your savings — from here, money starts working for you. It's where the curve bends from a line into an exponential."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "From age %lld, a year's investment gains outgrow your savings — from here, money starts working for you. It's where the curve bends from a line into an exponential."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld歳からは1年の投資収益が貯蓄を上回ります。ここからお金があなたの代わりに稼ぎます。曲線が直線から指数へ曲がる地点です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从%lld岁起，一年的投资收益超过储蓄——从这里开始，钱替你赚钱。这是曲线从直线弯向指数的拐点。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "從%lld歲起，一年的投資收益超過儲蓄——從這裡開始，錢替你賺錢。這是曲線從直線彎向指數的拐點。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A partir de los %lld años, lo que ganas invirtiendo en un año supera lo que ahorras: desde aquí el dinero trabaja por ti. Es el punto donde la curva pasa de recta a exponencial."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ab %lld übertreffen die Anlagegewinne eines Jahres deine Ersparnisse – ab hier arbeitet das Geld für dich. Das ist der Punkt, an dem die Kurve von der Geraden in die Exponentialkurve knickt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "À partir de %lld ans, les gains d’une année d’investissement dépassent votre épargne : à partir d’ici, l’argent travaille pour vous. C’est le point où la courbe passe de la droite à l’exponentielle."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dai %lld anni i guadagni di un anno di investimenti superano i tuoi risparmi: da qui il denaro lavora per te. È il punto in cui la curva passa da retta a esponenziale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
