    "가운데 선은 보통의 경우, 색칠한 띠는 좋을 때(상위 10%)와 나쁠 때(하위 10%) 사이예요. 점선이 퇴사하는 해예요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The line is the typical case; the band runs from good (top 10%) to bad (bottom 10%) markets. The dashed line is the year you quit."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "가운데 선은 보통의 경우, 색칠한 띠는 좋을 때(상위 10%)와 나쁠 때(하위 10%) 사이예요. 점선이 퇴사하는 해예요."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The line is the typical case; the band runs from good (top 10%) to bad (bottom 10%) markets. The dashed line is the year you quit."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中央の線は標準的なケース、色付きの帯は好調な相場（上位10%）と不調な相場（下位10%）の間です。点線が退職する年です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中间的线是一般情况，色带是行情好（前10%）与行情差（后10%）之间。虚线是你辞职的那一年。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "中間的線是一般情況，色帶是行情好（前10%）與行情差（後10%）之間。虛線是你離職的那一年。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La línea es el caso típico; la banda va de los mercados buenos (10 % superior) a los malos (10 % inferior). La línea discontinua es el año en que lo dejas."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Linie zeigt den typischen Fall, das Band reicht von guten (obere 10 %) bis schlechten Märkten (untere 10 %). Die gestrichelte Linie ist das Jahr deines Ausstiegs."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La ligne est le cas typique ; la bande va des bons marchés (10 % supérieurs) aux mauvais (10 % inférieurs). La ligne pointillée est l’année de votre départ."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La linea è il caso tipico; la fascia va dai mercati buoni (10% superiore) ai cattivi (10% inferiore). La linea tratteggiata è l’anno in cui smetti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
