    "계산기를 돌린 뒤 결과 아래 ‘저장’을 누르면\n그때 넣은 조건이 그대로 여기 쌓여요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the saved calculations feature.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After running a calculator, tap ‘Save’ below the result\nand the settings you used pile up here."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After running a calculator, tap ‘Save’ below the result\nand the settings you used pile up here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "計算機を回したあと、結果の下の「保存」をタップすると\nそのときの条件がここに溜まります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
