    "꺼내 쓸 수 있는 돈만으로 %lld세까지 버틸 확률이 85%%를 넘는 가장 이른 나이예요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The earliest age at which money you can actually spend has an 85%% chance of lasting to %lld."
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "꺼내 쓸 수 있는 돈만으로 %lld세까지 버틸 확률이 85%%를 넘는 가장 이른 나이예요."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The earliest age at which money you can actually spend has an 85%% chance of lasting to %lld."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取り崩せるお金だけで%lld歳まで持つ確率が85%%を超える、最も早い年齢です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是在只用可支取的钱的情况下，撑到%lld岁的概率超过85%%的最早年龄。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是在只用可支取的錢的情況下，撐到%lld歲的機率超過85%%的最早年齡。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Es la edad más temprana en la que, solo con dinero que realmente puedes gastar, la probabilidad de llegar a los %lld años supera el 85 %%."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das früheste Alter, in dem allein mit Geld, das du wirklich ausgeben kannst, die Chance, bis %lld durchzuhalten, über 85 %% liegt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "C’est l’âge le plus précoce auquel, avec le seul argent réellement dépensable, la chance de tenir jusqu’à %lld ans dépasse 85 %%."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "È l’età più precoce in cui, con il solo denaro che puoi davvero spendere, la probabilità di arrivare a %lld anni supera l’85%%."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "끄면 ‘6억원’처럼 억·만 단위로, 켜면 ‘600,000,000원’처럼 숫자로만 표시합니다. 앱 전체에 적용돼요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the display settings section.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off abbreviates large amounts in Korean units (eok = 100M, man = 10K); on shows full numbers like ‘600,000,000 won’. Applies across the whole app."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off abbreviates large amounts in Korean units (eok = 100M, man = 10K); on shows full numbers like ‘600,000,000 won’. Applies across the whole app."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると「6億ウォン」のように億・万の単位で、オンにすると「600,000,000ウォン」のように数字だけで表示します。アプリ全体に適用されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时以“6亿韩元”这样的亿、万为单位显示；开启时只显示“600,000,000韩元”这样的数字。适用于整个App。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "關閉時以「6億韓元」這樣的億、萬為單位顯示；開啟時只顯示「600,000,000韓元」這樣的數字。適用於整個App。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Desactivado abrevia los importes grandes en unidades coreanas (eok = 100 M, man = 10 mil); activado muestra cifras completas como «600.000.000 wones». Se aplica a toda la app."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus: große Beträge in koreanischen Einheiten (Eok = 100 Mio., Man = 10.000); an: volle Zahlen wie „600.000.000 Won“. Gilt für die ganze App."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Désactivé, les grands montants sont abrégés en unités coréennes (eok = 100 M, man = 10 000) ; activé, ils s’affichent en chiffres complets comme « 600 000 000 wons ». S’applique à toute l’app."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Disattivato abbrevia le cifre grandi in unità coreane (eok = 100 mln, man = 10.000); attivato mostra numeri interi come «600.000.000 won». Vale per tutta l’app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "끄면 원래 내 데이터로 그대로 돌아가요." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
