    "밀면 곡선이 바로 바뀌어요. 숫자를 누르면 직접 입력, 차트를 훑으면 나이별 자산." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the functionality of the view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drag and the curve changes right away. Tap a number to enter it directly; sweep the chart to see assets by age."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Drag and the curve changes right away. Tap a number to enter it directly; sweep the chart to see assets by age."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ドラッグすると曲線がすぐに変わります。数字をタップして直接入力、チャートをなぞると年齢別の資産が見られます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖动曲线会立刻变化。点按数字可直接输入，滑过图表可看到各年龄的资产。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖動曲線會立刻變化。點一下數字可直接輸入，滑過圖表可看到各年齡的資產。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Arrastra y la curva cambia al instante. Toca un número para introducirlo; desliza por el gráfico para ver los activos por edad."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zieh, und die Kurve ändert sich sofort. Tippe auf eine Zahl, um sie direkt einzugeben; wische übers Diagramm, um das Vermögen je Alter zu sehen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Faites glisser et la courbe change aussitôt. Touchez un chiffre pour le saisir ; parcourez le graphique pour voir les actifs par âge."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trascina e la curva cambia subito. Tocca un numero per inserirlo, scorri il grafico per vedere il patrimonio per età."
          }
        }
      }
    },
