    "성장 둔화는 시급이 오르는 속도가 해마다 얼마씩 꺾이는지예요. 8%면 올해 9%였던 성장률이 내년엔 8.3%가 돼요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the concept of \"decay\" in the context of time-based savings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Growth slowdown is how much the pace of wage growth fades each year. At 8%, this year's 9% growth becomes 8.3% next year."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Growth slowdown is how much the pace of wage growth fades each year. At 8%, this year's 9% growth becomes 8.3% next year."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "成長の鈍化は、時給の上がるペースが毎年どれだけ落ちるかです。8%なら、今年9%だった成長率が来年は8.3%になります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增速放缓指的是时薪上涨的速度每年下降多少。如果是8%，今年9%的增速明年会变成8.3%。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "增速放緩指的是時薪上漲的速度每年下降多少。如果是8%，今年9%的增速明年會變成8.3%。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La desaceleración del crecimiento es cuánto se frena cada año el ritmo de subida del sueldo por hora. Con un 8 %, el crecimiento del 9 % de este año pasa a 8,3 % el próximo."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wachstumsverlangsamung ist, um wie viel das Tempo des Lohnwachstums jedes Jahr nachlässt. Bei 8 % wird aus 9 % Wachstum dieses Jahr 8,3 % im nächsten."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le ralentissement de croissance est la baisse annuelle du rythme de hausse du salaire horaire. À 8 %, la croissance de 9 % de cette année devient 8,3 % l’an prochain."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il rallentamento della crescita indica di quanto cala ogni anno il ritmo di crescita della paga oraria. All’8%, la crescita del 9% di quest’anno diventa 8,3% l’anno prossimo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
