    "순자산은 예금·주식·집 같은 자산에서 빚을 뺀 금액이에요. 매달 모으는 돈은 월급에서 생활비를 쓰고 남는 돈이에요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the net worth and monthly savings fields.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Net worth is assets like deposits, stocks and a home minus debt. Monthly savings is what's left of your salary after living costs."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Net worth is assets like deposits, stocks and a home minus debt. Monthly savings is what's left of your salary after living costs."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "純資産は、預金・株式・家などの資産から借金を引いた金額です。毎月貯めるお金は、給料から生活費を使った残りです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "净资产是存款、股票、房子等资产减去债务后的金额。每月攒下的钱是月薪花掉生活费后剩下的部分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "淨資產是存款、股票、房子等資產減去債務後的金額。每月攢下的錢是月薪花掉生活費後剩下的部分。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El patrimonio neto es lo que suman activos como depósitos, acciones y vivienda menos la deuda. El ahorro mensual es lo que queda del sueldo tras los gastos de vida."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Nettovermögen ist die Summe aus Guthaben, Aktien und Haus abzüglich Schulden. Die monatliche Sparrate ist, was vom Gehalt nach den Lebenskosten übrig bleibt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le patrimoine net, c’est la somme d’actifs comme dépôts, actions et logement moins la dette. L’épargne mensuelle est ce qui reste du salaire après les frais de vie."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il patrimonio netto è la somma di attività come depositi, azioni e casa meno i debiti. Il risparmio mensile è ciò che resta dello stipendio dopo le spese di vita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "순자산은 자산 탭에 적어 둔 값을 그대로 써요. 매달 모으는 돈은 월급에서 생활비를 쓰고 남는 돈이에요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the net worth and monthly savings fields.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Net worth uses the values you entered on the Assets tab. Monthly savings is what's left of your salary after living costs."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Net worth uses the values you entered on the Assets tab. Monthly savings is what's left of your salary after living costs."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "純資産は、資産タブに入力した値をそのまま使います。毎月貯めるお金は、給料から生活費を使った残りです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "净资产直接使用你在资产页填写的值。每月攒下的钱是月薪花掉生活费后剩下的部分。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "淨資產直接使用你在資產頁填寫的值。每月攢下的錢是月薪花掉生活費後剩下的部分。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El patrimonio neto usa los valores que pusiste en la pestaña Activos. El ahorro mensual es lo que queda del sueldo tras los gastos de vida."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Nettovermögen nutzt die Werte, die du im Vermögen-Tab eingetragen hast. Die monatliche Sparrate ist, was vom Gehalt nach den Lebenskosten übrig bleibt."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le patrimoine net reprend les valeurs saisies dans l’onglet Actifs. L’épargne mensuelle est ce qui reste du salaire après les frais de vie."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il patrimonio netto usa i valori inseriti nella scheda Patrimonio. Il risparmio mensile è ciò che resta dello stipendio dopo le spese di vita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
