    "시급은 일하는 시간에만 붙는 국소 밀도예요. 하루 24시간 전체로 펴면 시간당 %@ 수준이에요." : {
      "comment" : "A paragraph explaining that the hourly wage is only valid for the time you work, and when you add it up for the whole month, it's only 3/10th of what it should be. The argument is the string “0원” or the string “%arg원”.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your hourly wage is a local density that only applies to hours you work. Spread over all 24 hours of the day, it's about %@ an hour."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your hourly wage is a local density that only applies to hours you work. Spread over all 24 hours of the day, it's about %@ an hour."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時給は働く時間にだけつく局所的な密度です。1日24時間全体に広げると、1時間あたり%@程度です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时薪是只附着在工作时间上的局部密度。摊到一天24小时，大约是每小时%@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "時薪是隻附著在工作時間上的區域性密度。攤到一天24小時，大約是每小時%@。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El sueldo por hora es una densidad local que solo se aplica a las horas que trabajas. Repartido en las 24 horas del día, son unos %@ por hora."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Stundenlohn ist eine lokale Dichte, die nur auf Arbeitsstunden entfällt. Auf alle 24 Stunden des Tages verteilt sind es etwa %@ pro Stunde."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le salaire horaire est une densité locale qui ne s’applique qu’aux heures travaillées. Réparti sur les 24 heures de la journée, cela fait environ %@ par heure."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La paga oraria è una densità locale che vale solo per le ore di lavoro. Distribuita sulle 24 ore del giorno, sono circa %@ all’ora."
          }
        }
      }
