    "실질임금 = 명목임금 ÷ 소비자물가지수 × 100. 인상률이 그해 물가상승률보다 낮으면 실질임금은 마이너스예요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to calculate the real wage.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Real wage = nominal wage ÷ consumer price index × 100. If your raise is lower than that year's inflation, your real wage goes down."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Real wage = nominal wage ÷ consumer price index × 100. If your raise is lower than that year's inflation, your real wage goes down."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "実質賃金＝名目賃金÷消費者物価指数×100。昇給率がその年の物価上昇率より低いと、実質賃金はマイナスです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "实际工资＝名义工资÷消费者物价指数×100。如果涨薪幅度低于当年物价涨幅，实际工资就是负的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "實際工資＝名義工資÷消費者物價指數×100。如果漲薪幅度低於當年物價漲幅，實際工資就是負的。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sueldo real = sueldo nominal ÷ índice de precios al consumo × 100. Si tu subida es menor que la inflación de ese año, tu sueldo real baja."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reallohn = Nominallohn ÷ Verbraucherpreisindex × 100. Liegt deine Erhöhung unter der Inflation des Jahres, sinkt dein Reallohn."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salaire réel = salaire nominal ÷ indice des prix à la consommation × 100. Si votre augmentation est inférieure à l’inflation de l’année, votre salaire réel baisse."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Salario reale = salario nominale ÷ indice dei prezzi al consumo × 100. Se l’aumento è inferiore all’inflazione di quell’anno, il salario reale scende."
          }
        }
      }
    },
