    "예정된 수입만 더한 값입니다. 주식·부동산 등 자산 가치가 오를 거라는 가정은 넣지 않았어요." : {
      "comment" : "The footer text for the `ProjectionDetailView`.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only adds scheduled income. It doesn't assume stocks, property or other assets will rise in value."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This only adds scheduled income. It doesn't assume stocks, property or other assets will rise in value."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "予定された収入だけを足した値です。株式や不動産などの資産価値が上がるという仮定は入れていません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这只是加上预定收入后的值。没有假设股票、房产等资产价值会上涨。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這只是加上預定收入後的值。沒有假設股票、房產等資產價值會上漲。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto solo suma ingresos previstos. No supone que suban de valor las acciones, los inmuebles u otros activos."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hier werden nur geplante Einnahmen addiert. Es wird nicht angenommen, dass Aktien, Immobilien oder andere Vermögen im Wert steigen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cela n’additionne que les revenus prévus. Cela ne suppose pas que les actions, l’immobilier ou d’autres actifs prendront de la valeur."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Somma solo le entrate programmate. Non ipotizza che azioni, immobili o altre attività salgano di valore."
          }
        }
      }
    },
