    "월급은 올랐어도 물가가 더 올라서, 실제 살 수 있는 양은 줄었어요." : {
      "comment" : "Text describing the difference between real and nominal wages.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary rose, but prices rose more, so what you can actually buy went down."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary rose, but prices rose more, so what you can actually buy went down."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "給料は上がったのに物価がもっと上がり、実際に買える量は減りました。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "月薪涨了，但物价涨得更多，实际能买到的东西减少了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "月薪漲了，但物價漲得更多，實際能買到的東西減少了。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu sueldo subió, pero los precios subieron más, así que lo que realmente puedes comprar bajó."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein Gehalt ist gestiegen, aber die Preise sind stärker gestiegen, deshalb ist das, was du dir tatsächlich leisten kannst, gesunken."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre salaire a augmenté, mais les prix ont augmenté davantage : ce que vous pouvez réellement acheter a diminué."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo stipendio è salito, ma i prezzi sono saliti di più, quindi ciò che puoi davvero comprare è diminuito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
