    "이 숫자는 정답이 아니라 방향을 잡는 닻이에요. 매일 쫓을 필요는 없어요 — 방향만 맞으면, 나머지는 이번 주 한 칸씩이면 돼요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the \"Enough Ancher\" tip.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This number isn't the answer; it's an anchor for direction. You don't have to chase it daily — if the direction is right, one small step a week does the rest."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This number isn't the answer; it's an anchor for direction. You don't have to chase it daily — if the direction is right, one small step a week does the rest."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この数字は正解ではなく、方向を決める錨です。毎日追いかける必要はありません。方向さえ合っていれば、あとは今週1歩ずつで十分です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个数字不是标准答案，而是定方向的锚。不用每天追着它——方向对了，其余只要每周迈一小步就行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這個數字不是標準答案，而是定方向的錨。不用每天追著它——方向對了，其餘只要每週邁一小步就行。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este número no es la respuesta, sino un ancla para fijar el rumbo. No hace falta perseguirlo cada día: si el rumbo es el correcto, el resto es un pequeño paso a la semana."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Zahl ist nicht die Antwort, sondern ein Anker für die Richtung. Du musst ihr nicht täglich hinterherlaufen – stimmt die Richtung, genügt ein kleiner Schritt pro Woche."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce chiffre n’est pas la réponse, c’est une ancre pour garder le cap. Inutile de le poursuivre chaque jour : si la direction est bonne, un petit pas par semaine suffit."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questo numero non è la risposta ma un’ancora per la direzione. Non serve rincorrerlo ogni giorno: se la direzione è giusta, basta un piccolo passo a settimana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
