    "일을 그만둔 뒤 매달 쓰고 싶은 돈이에요. 지금 생활비를 떠올리면 쉬워요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the monthly amount the user wants to save each month.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you want to spend each month after you stop working. Think of your current living costs."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "What you want to spend each month after you stop working. Think of your current living costs."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仕事を辞めたあとに毎月使いたいお金です。今の生活費を思い浮かべると簡単です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你不再工作后每月想花的钱。想想现在的生活费就容易了。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你不再工作後每月想花的錢。想想現在的生活費就容易了。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo que quieres gastar cada mes cuando dejes de trabajar. Piensa en tus gastos de vida actuales."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was du jeden Monat ausgeben möchtest, wenn du nicht mehr arbeitest. Denk an deine heutigen Lebenskosten."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce que vous voulez dépenser chaque mois quand vous ne travaillez plus. Pensez à vos frais de vie actuels."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quello che vuoi spendere ogni mese quando smetti di lavorare. Pensa alle tue spese di vita attuali."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "일하지 않아도 돈이 들어오게 하는 대표적인 방법이에요. 누르면 바로 그 자산을 추가할 수 있어요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of a section that shows how to make passive income.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Typical ways to have money come in without working. Tap to add that asset right away."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Typical ways to have money come in without working. Tap to add that asset right away."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "働かなくてもお金が入る代表的な方法です。タップするとすぐその資産を追加できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
