          }
        }
      }
    },
    "자산 탭에서 자산을 등록하면\n변동이 생길 때마다 자동으로 기록이 쌓입니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how assets are recorded automatically.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Register assets on the Assets tab\nand records are added automatically whenever something changes."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Register assets on the Assets tab\nand records are added automatically whenever something changes."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "資産タブで資産を登録すると、\n変動があるたびに自動で記録が溜まります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在资产页登记资产后，\n每当有变动就会自动累积记录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在資產頁登記資產後，\n每當有變動就會自動累積記錄。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registra activos en la pestaña Activos\ny los registros se añaden solos cada vez que algo cambie."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trag Vermögen im Vermögen-Tab ein,\nund bei jeder Änderung entstehen automatisch Einträge."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Enregistrez des actifs dans l’onglet Actifs\net des enregistrements s’ajoutent automatiquement à chaque changement."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Registra le attività nella scheda Patrimonio\ne le registrazioni si accumulano da sole a ogni cambiamento."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "자산 탭에서 주식의 배당률, 부동산의 월세, 예금의 이자율을 넣으면 여기에 월·주 수입이 표시됩니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the user can see their monthly and weekly income on the \"Dashboard\" screen.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the Assets tab, enter a stock's dividend yield, a property's rent or a deposit's interest rate and monthly and weekly income appear here."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On the Assets tab, enter a stock's dividend yield, a property's rent or a deposit's interest rate and monthly and weekly income appear here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "資産タブで株式の配当率、不動産の家賃、預金の利率を入れると、ここに月・週の収入が表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在资产页填入股票的股息率、房产的租金或存款的利率，这里就会显示月收入和周收入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在資產頁填入股票的殖利率、房產的租金或存款的利率，這裡就會顯示月收入和周收入。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En la pestaña Activos, introduce el dividendo de una acción, el alquiler de un inmueble o el interés de un depósito y aquí aparecerán los ingresos mensuales y semanales."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trag im Vermögen-Tab die Dividendenrendite einer Aktie, die Miete einer Immobilie oder den Zins eines Guthabens ein, dann erscheinen hier Monats- und Wocheneinnahmen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans l’onglet Actifs, saisissez le rendement d’une action, le loyer d’un bien ou le taux d’un dépôt et les revenus mensuels et hebdomadaires s’affichent ici."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nella scheda Patrimonio inserisci il rendimento da dividendo di un’azione, l’affitto di un immobile o il tasso di un deposito e qui compaiono i redditi mensili e settimanali."
          }
        }
      }
    },
