    "지금 월급 %@은 %@년 월급을 오늘 물가로 옮긴 %@보다 %@ 많아요." : {
      "comment" : "A text that compares the real wage (what you can buy with your salary) from a past year to the current year. If the result is positive, it means that your salary has increased. If the result is negative, it means that your salary has decreased.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지금 월급 %1$@은 %2$@년 월급을 오늘 물가로 옮긴 %3$@보다 %4$@ 많아요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary now, %1$@, is %4$@ more than your %2$@ salary in today's prices (%3$@)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary now, %1$@, is %4$@ more than your %2$@ salary in today's prices (%3$@)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在の月給%1$@は、%2$@年の月給を今の物価に換算した%3$@より%4$@多いです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在的月薪%1$@，比把%2$@年的月薪折算成今天物价后的%3$@多%4$@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在的月薪%1$@，比把%2$@年的月薪折算成今天物價後的%3$@多%4$@。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu sueldo actual, %1$@, es un %4$@ superior al de %2$@ a precios de hoy (%3$@)."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein jetziges Gehalt %1$@ liegt %4$@ über dem Gehalt von %2$@ in heutigen Preisen (%3$@)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre salaire actuel, %1$@, est supérieur de %4$@ à celui de %2$@ aux prix d’aujourd’hui (%3$@)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo stipendio attuale %1$@ è superiore del %4$@ a quello del %2$@ ai prezzi di oggi (%3$@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "지금 월급 %@은 %@년 월급을 오늘 물가로 옮긴 %@보다 %@ 적어요. 그만큼 구매력이 깎인 셈이에요." : {
      "comment" : "A sentence that compares the real purchasing power of a current salary to that of the same salary in the past.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "지금 월급 %1$@은 %2$@년 월급을 오늘 물가로 옮긴 %3$@보다 %4$@ 적어요. 그만큼 구매력이 깎인 셈이에요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary now, %1$@, is %4$@ less than your %2$@ salary in today's prices (%3$@). That's how much purchasing power was lost."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your salary now, %1$@, is %4$@ less than your %2$@ salary in today's prices (%3$@). That's how much purchasing power was lost."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在の月給%1$@は、%2$@年の月給を今の物価に換算した%3$@より%4$@少ないです。それだけ購買力が削られたことになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在的月薪%1$@，比把%2$@年的月薪折算成今天物价后的%3$@少%4$@。相当于购买力被削减了这么多。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在的月薪%1$@，比把%2$@年的月薪折算成今天物價後的%3$@少%4$@。相當於購買力被削減了這麼多。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu sueldo actual, %1$@, es un %4$@ inferior al de %2$@ a precios de hoy (%3$@). Es el poder adquisitivo que has perdido."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dein jetziges Gehalt %1$@ liegt %4$@ unter dem Gehalt von %2$@ in heutigen Preisen (%3$@). So viel Kaufkraft ist dir verloren gegangen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Votre salaire actuel, %1$@, est inférieur de %4$@ à celui de %2$@ aux prix d’aujourd’hui (%3$@). C’est le pouvoir d’achat perdu."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il tuo stipendio attuale %1$@ è inferiore del %4$@ a quello del %2$@ ai prezzi di oggi (%3$@). È il potere d’acquisto perso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "지금 월급도 넣으면 최근 물가(%@년)까지 이어서 볼 수 있어요." : {
      "comment" : "A message that appears when the user hasn't entered their current salary.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add your current salary too to see up to recent prices (%@)."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Add your current salary too to see up to recent prices (%@)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在の月給も入れると、最近の物価（%@年）まで続けて見られます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再填入现在的月薪，就能一直看到最近的物价（%@年）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "再填入現在的月薪，就能一直看到最近的物價（%@年）。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Añade también tu sueldo actual para ver hasta los precios recientes (%@)."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
