    "투자 수익률(%@)이 부채 이자율(%@)보다 높기 때문이에요. 단, 투자는 손실 위험이 있어요." : {
      "comment" : "The second clause is a bit more technical.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "투자 수익률(%1$@)이 부채 이자율(%2$@)보다 높기 때문이에요. 단, 투자는 손실 위험이 있어요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Because the investment return (%@) is higher than the debt interest rate (%@). But investing carries a risk of loss."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Because the investment return (%@) is higher than the debt interest rate (%@). But investing carries a risk of loss."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投資リターン（%@）が負債の利率（%@）より高いためです。ただし、投資には損失のリスクがあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因为投资收益率（%@）高于债务利率（%@）。不过，投资有亏损的风险。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "因為投資報酬率（%@）高於債務利率（%@）。不過，投資有虧損的風險。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Porque la rentabilidad de la inversión (%@) es mayor que el tipo de interés de la deuda (%@). Eso sí, invertir conlleva riesgo de pérdida."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Weil die Anlagerendite (%@) höher ist als der Schuldzins (%@). Allerdings birgt Anlegen ein Verlustrisiko."
