    "투자 원금 (산 가격, 원)" : {
      "comment" : "A label for the user to enter the original price of the asset.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cost basis (purchase price, won)"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cost basis (purchase price, won)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投資元本（購入価格、ウォン）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投资本金（买入价，韩元）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投資本金（買入價，韓元）"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Capital invertido (precio de compra, wones)"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eingesetztes Kapital (Kaufpreis, Won)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Capital investi (prix d’achat, wons)"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Capitale investito (prezzo d’acquisto, won)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "투자 원금(산 가격)은 그대로 두고, 평가액은 시세에 따라 바뀝니다. 둘의 차이가 평가 손익이에요. 평가액은 위 ‘평가액’ 칸 또는 시세 자동으로 갱신돼요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the investment amount and the value of the asset.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cost basis (purchase price) stays fixed while market value moves with prices. The difference is the unrealized gain or loss. Market value updates from the ‘Market value’ field above or auto price."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cost basis (purchase price) stays fixed while market value moves with prices. The difference is the unrealized gain or loss. Market value updates from the ‘Market value’ field above or auto price."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投資元本（購入価格）はそのままで、評価額は価格に応じて変わります。その差が評価損益です。評価額は上の「評価額」欄または自動価格で更新されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投资本金（买入价）保持不变，估值随行情变动。两者之差就是估值盈亏。估值会通过上方“估值”栏或自动行情更新。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投資本金（買入價）保持不變，估值隨行情變動。兩者之差就是估值盈虧。估值會透過上方「估值」欄或自動行情更新。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El capital invertido (precio de compra) se mantiene fijo mientras el valor de mercado cambia con los precios. La diferencia es la ganancia o pérdida latente. El valor de mercado se actualiza desde el campo «Valor de mercado» de arriba o con el precio automático."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das eingesetzte Kapital (Kaufpreis) bleibt fest, während der Marktwert mit den Kursen schwankt. Die Differenz ist der Buchgewinn oder -verlust. Der Marktwert wird über das Feld „Marktwert“ oben oder den Auto-Kurs aktualisiert."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le capital investi (prix d’achat) reste fixe tandis que la valeur de marché suit les cours. La différence est le gain ou la perte latent. La valeur de marché se met à jour depuis le champ « Valeur de marché » ci-dessus ou le cours automatique."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il capitale investito (prezzo d’acquisto) resta fisso mentre il valore di mercato varia con i prezzi. La differenza è l’utile o la perdita latente. Il valore di mercato si aggiorna dal campo «Valore di mercato» qui sopra o dal prezzo automatico."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "투자 원금과 보유 수량은 아래 ‘매매 내역’에서 자동으로 계산돼요. 평가액은 시세나 위 ‘평가액’ 칸을 따르고, 둘의 차이가 평가 손익입니다." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the investment amount and the number of holdings.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cost basis and quantity are calculated automatically from ‘Trade history’ below. Market value follows the price or the ‘Market value’ field above, and the difference is the unrealized gain/loss."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cost basis and quantity are calculated automatically from ‘Trade history’ below. Market value follows the price or the ‘Market value’ field above, and the difference is the unrealized gain/loss."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投資元本と保有数量は、下の「売買履歴」から自動計算されます。評価額は価格、または上の「評価額」欄に従い、その差が評価損益です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投资本金和持有数量会根据下方“交易明细”自动计算。估值遵循行情或上方“估值”栏，两者之差就是估值盈亏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "投資本金和持有數量會根據下方「交易明細」自動計算。估值遵循行情或上方「估值」欄，兩者之差就是估值盈虧。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El capital invertido y la cantidad se calculan automáticamente a partir del «Historial de operaciones» de abajo. El valor de mercado sigue el precio o el campo «Valor de mercado» de arriba, y la diferencia es la ganancia/pérdida latente."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Eingesetztes Kapital und Stückzahl werden automatisch aus dem „Handelsverlauf“ unten berechnet. Der Marktwert folgt dem Kurs oder dem Feld „Marktwert“ oben, und die Differenz ist der Buchgewinn/-verlust."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le capital investi et la quantité sont calculés automatiquement à partir de l’« Historique des opérations » ci-dessous. La valeur de marché suit le cours ou le champ « Valeur de marché » ci-dessus, et la différence est le gain/perte latent."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Capitale investito e quantità si calcolano in automatico dalla «Cronologia operazioni» qui sotto. Il valore di mercato segue il prezzo o il campo «Valore di mercato» qui sopra, e la differenza è l’utile/perdita latente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
