    "평가액을 종목별로 쪼개 관리할 수 있어요. 예) 주식 3,000만원 → 삼성전자 1,000만 + 애플 2,000만." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to allocate the total value of an asset into individual investments.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can split market value across individual holdings. E.g. stocks 30M won → Samsung Electronics 10M + Apple 20M."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You can split market value across individual holdings. E.g. stocks 30M won → Samsung Electronics 10M + Apple 20M."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "評価額を銘柄ごとに分けて管理できます。例）株式3,000万ウォン → サムスン電子1,000万＋Apple 2,000万。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以把估值拆分到各个持仓管理。例）股票3,000万韩元 → 三星电子1,000万＋苹果2,000万。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以把估值拆分到各個持倉管理。例）股票3,000萬韓元 → 三星電子1,000萬＋蘋果2,000萬。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Puedes repartir el valor de mercado entre valores concretos. P. ej., acciones 30 M de wones → Samsung Electronics 10 M + Apple 20 M."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du kannst den Marktwert auf einzelne Positionen aufteilen. Z. B. Aktien 30 Mio. Won → Samsung Electronics 10 Mio. + Apple 20 Mio."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Vous pouvez répartir la valeur de marché entre des positions. Ex. actions 30 M de wons → Samsung Electronics 10 M + Apple 20 M."
