    "하루는 누구나 24시간이지만 두께는 달라요. 저가치 시간을 돈으로 사서 없애면 하루가 두꺼워져요." : {
      "comment" : "A description of how the thickness of a day changes based on the time spent.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everyone has 24 hours a day, but they differ in thickness. Buy off low-value time with money and your day gets thicker."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Everyone has 24 hours a day, but they differ in thickness. Buy off low-value time with money and your day gets thicker."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1日は誰にとっても24時間ですが、厚みは違います。価値の低い時間をお金で買って減らすと、1日が厚くなります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个人一天都是24小时，但厚度不同。用钱买走并消除低价值时间，一天就会变厚。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每個人一天都是24小時，但厚度不同。用錢買走並消除低價值時間，一天就會變厚。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos tenemos 24 horas al día, pero con distinto grosor. Si compras con dinero el tiempo de poco valor y lo eliminas, tu día se hace más grueso."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder hat 24 Stunden am Tag, aber in unterschiedlicher Dicke. Kaufst du wenig wertvolle Zeit mit Geld weg, wird dein Tag dicker."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chacun a 24 heures par jour, mais d’épaisseur différente. Achetez avec de l’argent le temps de faible valeur pour le supprimer et votre journée s’épaissit."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tutti hanno 24 ore al giorno, ma di spessore diverso. Compra con il denaro il tempo di poco valore e la tua giornata si fa più spessa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
